    {
      "title": "North Korean Official Dismisses Reduced Drills Between US and South Korea",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/world/asia/north-korea-trump-military-drills.html",
      "description": "Kim Yo-jong, a powerful adviser and sister of Kim Jong-un, also said she was “unaware” of any communication with Washington, contradicting President Trump’s claim her brother had responded to his outreach.",
